WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.490
﻿Sei, wake up!

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.850
﻿Okay.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.290
﻿Good morning, mom.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.590
﻿Yes, good morning.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.660
﻿Where's Reiji?

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.200
﻿Still sleeping.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.400
﻿I went to wake him up.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.430
﻿But he kicked me
﻿and told me to shut up.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.670
﻿So I left him alone.

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.410
﻿He's a strange boy, isn't he?

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.610
﻿He's so weird!
﻿The way he looks and acts...

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.680
﻿He has no common sense either.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.710
﻿But...

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.320
﻿Yum! This is so good!

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.090
﻿You're too kind, Reiji.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.990
Th﻿is vegetable stir-fry is my favorite.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.520
﻿You want more?

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.830
﻿Sure!

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.430
﻿He isn't that bad.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.330
﻿I'm done eating. I'm off.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.670
﻿What about Reiji?

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.270
﻿You're the one who let him in, mom.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.170
﻿You deal with him.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.010
﻿Bye.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.980
﻿Why is he so mad?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.940
﻿Reiji, let's do this together!

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.450
﻿- Do what together?
﻿- Gunpla Battle!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.980
﻿I'll build the Gunpla,
﻿and you control it.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.090
﻿Then we'll enter the championship!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:58.460
﻿Your control skills in that battle
﻿were really incredible.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:03.190
﻿With my Gunpla and your technique...

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:04.930
﻿No, I can't be bothered.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.060
﻿What!?

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.230
﻿Why? Doesn't Gunpla Battle
﻿interest you?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.430
﻿Not really.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.070
﻿Then why did you fight just now?

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:15.410
﻿I was just paying you back.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:18.310
﻿I kept my promise. It's over now.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.380
﻿Are you kidding me!?

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:24.580
﻿Then how will you pay me back
﻿for last night's dinner?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.290
﻿I owe that to your mom, not you.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:31.190
﻿I was going to pay her back
﻿for that anyway.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.520
﻿And for letting me
﻿stay here tonight, too.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.730
﻿Stay here tonight...?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.200
﻿Nighty night.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.640
﻿What's wrong with you?
﻿You're so selfish!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:50.210
﻿At least brush your teeth!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.950
What happened to
"in any situation, I'll come running"?

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.820
﻿Good morning.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.550
﻿You were sleeping well.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:06.360
Is bread okay for breakfast?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.390
﻿Yeah, anything's fine.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.730
﻿Where's Sei?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.360
﻿He's gone to school.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.230
﻿School? What's school?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:21.970
It's where all the children
﻿around Sei's age go to study.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:25.010
﻿Wake up, Reiji.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.580
﻿School, huh...

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:33.580
﻿From this line, you can see
﻿that he found it important,

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:37.050
﻿to spill out his true feelings
﻿in order to resolve the situation.

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:40.320
﻿I can't count on Reiji anymore.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.460
﻿I have to fight by myself.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:47.570
﻿My Build Strike must be fully
﻿equipped before the championship.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.600
﻿First the weapons.
﻿The rifle's performance...

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.440
﻿Iori, can you answer this question?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.710
﻿I'm fretting over it.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.810
﻿If the output is too high,
﻿then the rifle will have to be larger,

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:05.620
﻿which hurts the maneuverability.
﻿You can't fire it quickly, either.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:09.750
﻿So I have to think of a way to
﻿freely change the beam output,

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:13.060
﻿without increasing
﻿the size of the rifle.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.730
﻿The answer is two-thirds!

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:20.900
﻿This is a literature class!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.560
﻿I-I'm sorry.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.610
﻿Sei's mom...

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.870
Yes?

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.710
This is a store, right?

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:33.840
﻿That's right.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.850
﻿No customers?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.250
﻿I know.

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:44.190
﻿How boring.
﻿I came all the way here for this.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.630
﻿Thanks for the notebook, China.
﻿It helped a lot.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:52.960
﻿It's okay.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.930
﻿I'm sorry to interrupt
﻿your precious break.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.800
﻿Oh please, come on in!

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.740
﻿That's President Yuuki,
﻿from the senior high school.

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.510
﻿What brings him here?

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.710
﻿I'm Kousaka of the class committee.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.780
﻿May I help you?

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.220
﻿No, it's not that.

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:17.020
﻿I'm not here as council president, but
﻿as captain of the model-building club.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.520
﻿Sei Iori.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:22.790
﻿Huh? Yuuki.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:27.000
﻿May I talk to you during lunch break?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.830
﻿Me?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.240
﻿Yes, please.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.180
﻿Well done, everyone!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.410
﻿Especially this Old Type Zaku.
﻿Check out the weathering.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:48.520
﻿It really shows how the Zeon forces
﻿had to deploy even old machines.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:52.720
﻿Thank you. I built that model myself.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:55.990
﻿You did? That's amazing!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:59.130
﻿No, it's not as good as yours.

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:03.600
﻿To be honest, I've been to
﻿Iori Models a few times.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:07.370
I've been a fan of your work
ever since.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.970
﻿Really?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:15.350
﻿So you came to see me because...

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:18.220
﻿You want me to join
﻿the model-building club?

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:22.390
﻿If so, I'm really sorry, but
﻿I have to help with the store.

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:24.620
﻿No, it's not about that.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.160
﻿Even though I wanted that, too...

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.230
﻿Then...?

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.660
﻿Iori, I heard rumors.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.760
﻿You won against Sazaki, right?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:37.230
﻿Sazaki is famous around this district
﻿for his strong skills.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.370
﻿You beat that guy at Gunpla Battle.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:47.310
﻿I assume that you're entering
﻿the Gunpla Battle Championship.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.050
﻿Y-Yeah.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.820
﻿Alright. I can't wait.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.020
﻿Now I'll be able to fight your models.

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.190
﻿No, no.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.620
﻿You got through the championship
﻿preliminaries last year,

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.960
﻿and you even made it to
﻿the World Tournament.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.730
﻿I won't stand a chance.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.430
﻿- Plus...
- Plus?

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:10.630
﻿It wasn't my own strength
﻿that beat Sazaki.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.710
﻿I wonder what Yuuki wanted from Iori?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.440
﻿He's probably asking Iori to
﻿join the model-building club.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.910
﻿Iori's family runs a
﻿hobby shop, right?

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.210
﻿Yes, they do.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:25.250
﻿I get it now...

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.820
﻿That looks delicious.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:29.190
﻿Huh?

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.320
﻿Here, have some.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:33.990
﻿Really? Thanks.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.290
﻿It's really good.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:39.360
﻿Who's that?

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.430
﻿Oh yeah.
﻿This is what you call school right?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.570
﻿Is Sei here?

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:44.900
﻿Sei?

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:47.200
﻿Are you talking about Iori?

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.170
﻿Yeah, Sei Iori.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:51.180
﻿I knew he'd be here.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.740
﻿- And you are...?
- ﻿Hey, you there!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.860
﻿You're on the grounds of
﻿the Seiho Academy.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:59.180
﻿You're not a student here, are you?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.050
﻿I came to see Sei.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.420
﻿I couldn't care less.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:04.790
﻿Get out now!

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:07.520
﻿You're rude. Who are you?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.390
﻿I'm an executive member
﻿of the student council.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:15.370
﻿We work to protect our students
﻿from disruptive people like you.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.970
﻿I didn't do anything.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:20.440
﻿The fact that you're here
﻿is a problem already.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.410
﻿Just get off school property.

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:25.540
﻿I told you, I just came to see Sei.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.340
﻿Are you disobeying me?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.050
﻿You messed with me first.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.200
You...

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:34.890
﻿What should we do?

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:37.090
﻿There's nothing we can do.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.990
﻿China, where are you going?

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.760
I see.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.230
﻿Another fighter was
﻿controlling your Gunpla...

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.360
Yes.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.970
﻿It's because of him
﻿I was able to beat Sazaki.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.800
﻿I'm even more intrigued.
﻿The championship will really—

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:56.110
﻿But he says he's not interested
﻿in Gunpla Battle.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.010
﻿So I've given up on Reiji.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:00.940
﻿Reiji.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.080
﻿So that's your partner's name.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.080
﻿- Iori!
- ﻿Kousaka? What's wrong?

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:07.480
﻿There's a problem!

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.090
﻿What kind of problem?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.660
﻿Reiji! What are you doing!

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:15.860
﻿Hey, Sei!

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:18.630
﻿Minding the store was boring,
﻿so I came to see you.

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.800
﻿What are you talking about?
You aren't even a student here!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.400
﻿That's right. You better—

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.100
﻿No more! Ow!

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:28.710
﻿Why are you doing this to me?

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:32.940
﻿So he's Reiji...

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:36.210
﻿Where's Reiji?

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:40.280
He ﻿said he'd help with the store
﻿to thank me for the meals.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.390
﻿But why, President?

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.120
﻿Why did you allow that
﻿outsider into the school,

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.130
﻿without even informing the teachers?

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:49.660
﻿What's up with him?

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.030
﻿Shut up.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.300
﻿Sorry, Gonda.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.530
﻿I forgot to tell the council executives.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.640
﻿Reiji over there is someone
﻿I invited to this school.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.310
﻿What?

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.310
- ﻿That's not true.
﻿- Shut up.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.280
﻿Not as student council president,

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:11.150
﻿but as captain of
﻿the model-building club.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.850
﻿Reiji is an outstanding
﻿Gunpla Fighter.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.750
﻿He beat that Sazaki.

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.420
﻿Isn't that right, Iori?

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.820
﻿Y-Yeah.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:22.930
﻿You won against Sazaki?
﻿I can't believe it.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.030
﻿Who's Sazaki?

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.700
﻿You beat him in the battle yesterday.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.830
﻿Oh, that big mouth.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.040
﻿You've got a big mouth yourself, kid.

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:34.240
﻿You've got one too, you gorilla.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:42.110
﻿President, I mean Captain,
﻿I have a suggestion.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:46.050
﻿Since you invited this
﻿talented guy all the way here,

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:50.490
﻿why not have him show off
his ability in Gunpla Battle?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:54.020
﻿I'll be his opponent, as a member
﻿of the model-building club.

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:57.960
﻿What do you say?

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.100
- ﻿Sure thing.
- ﻿But...

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.330
﻿You're gonna regret it.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:04.370
﻿Alright then.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:09.810
﻿You guys can choose whichever
﻿Gunpla you like from our display.

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:11.580
﻿No, that's fine.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:13.510
﻿I have my Gunpla with me.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:18.020
﻿Of course you do.
﻿You came prepared, Iori.

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:23.690
﻿But only members of our club are
﻿allowed to bring Gunpla to school.

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.590
﻿I know. I'm sorry.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:32.530
﻿Hey, I heard Yuuki is about to
﻿play Gunpla Battle in the gym.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.470
﻿He's fighting a freshman who
﻿isn't even a club member.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:40.370
﻿Why is there a battle system here?
﻿It's really expensive.

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:44.040
﻿Yuuki's father is the chairman of
﻿the school's support association,

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:46.310
﻿and he donated a ton of money
﻿to the model-building club.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:50.350
﻿Yuuki isn't just cute, he's rich too?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.750
﻿If only his hobby was playing in
﻿a band, instead of model-building.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.990
﻿Come on, that gap is
﻿what makes him attractive.

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:58.390
﻿Look, Gonda's gonna play.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.530
﻿What? It's not Yuuki?

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:02.890
﻿Who's that gorilla?

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:04.530
﻿I'm not a gorilla!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.260
﻿Is that a middle school student?

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.000
﻿He's cute.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.300
﻿Who is he?

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:13.240
﻿Iori. And that boy...

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.140
﻿Are you ready?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.570
﻿Yes, Captain.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.880
﻿We're ready.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.010
﻿Anytime now.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:24.980
﻿Okay, we're about to start
﻿an exhibition match of Gunpla Battle,

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:27.420
﻿hosted by the Seiho Academy
﻿model-building club.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.420
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:39.560
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.800
﻿It's beautiful.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.710
﻿That's the light of the Plavsky particles.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:53.380
﻿These particles, invented 10 years ago,

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:57.880
﻿react only with the plastic
﻿from which Gunpla is made.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:03.520
﻿By fluidly controlling the
﻿high-density Plavsky particles,

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:06.790
﻿you can breathe life
﻿into inanimate Gunpla.

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:10.230
﻿And, thanks to
﻿particle transformation,

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:13.560
﻿effects such as beams and
﻿explosions are also added.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:17.330
﻿The sense of realism
﻿is almost lifelike.

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:20.570
﻿This is Gunpla Battle, miss.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.340
﻿Who is this old guy?

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.450
<i>﻿Field 5, City.</i>

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.820
<i>﻿Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.420
﻿This is my Gunpla, Sumo!

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.260
﻿Weapons are the same
﻿as yesterday. Got it?

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.900
﻿Leave it to me.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.100
﻿Piece of cake!

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.600
﻿Launch!

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:07.020
﻿Iori's new model is amazing.

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:22.500
﻿Reiji's control is really good.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:24.900
﻿He's winning.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.870
﻿He's a talented fighter.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.570
﻿But...

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.940
﻿Hey, is that all?

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.510
﻿Above you!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.710
﻿Don't underestimate me!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.720
﻿Gotcha!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:51.960
﻿That was close.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.860
﻿He can dodge that?

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.600
﻿I'm getting excited.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:59.670
﻿You should be dead already!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.410
﻿Sorry about that.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.540
﻿Oh no!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.210
﻿What's that?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:15.290
﻿The stage is changing because
﻿they blew a hole in the colony.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.220
﻿How will they fight in
﻿such a fierce airflow?

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.700
- ﻿Charge right up to him!
﻿- Seriously!?

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:30.170
﻿High-output guns like that
﻿have a time lag before the next shot.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.970
﻿Go, Reiji!

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.540
﻿Alright.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.180
﻿What a fool. You're charging
﻿against this headwind!?

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:44.280
﻿He's getting away!

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.580
﻿My Build Strike can do it!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.620
﻿Go!

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.470
﻿M-My Gunpla...

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:11.640
- ﻿Gonda was defeated!?
- ﻿The gorilla lost!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:15.810
﻿Don't call me a gorilla!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.080
﻿Reiji.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.950
﻿Ouch.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:32.230
﻿That ended a little too quickly.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:37.100
﻿I feel badly for
﻿the audience that showed up.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.500
﻿Don't you agree?

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.040
﻿Yes.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.840
﻿I think so.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.810
﻿Yuuki?

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:48.950
﻿That jerk...

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.350
﻿Just as I thought.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.290
﻿It entered last year's Gunpla Battle
﻿Championship World Tournament.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.020
﻿It's Tatsuya Yuuki's Zaku Amazing.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:06.130
﻿The best among all high-schoolers,
﻿people call him the "Crimson Comet"!

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:10.000
﻿Crimson Comet...?

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.940
- ﻿Let's do this, Sei.
- ﻿Reiji!?

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.840
﻿He's messing with us.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.770
﻿We can't run away now!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:22.150
﻿Sorry. And thank you.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:25.480
﻿I mean I apologize for
﻿barging into the battle.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.550
﻿And I'm grateful for
﻿giving me the chance...

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.490
﻿to fight against you guys!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.820
﻿Shut up.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.230
- ﻿He dodged!?
- ﻿But we're upwind of him!

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:48.870
﻿He's quick.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:56.380
﻿Rage on...

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:01.320
﻿Rage on!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:06.020
﻿Gunpla!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.040
﻿It can't be...

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.710
﻿What was that?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:28.280
﻿Yuuki won!

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.110
﻿Amazing, it only took him seconds.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.050
﻿Yuuki!

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:38.860
﻿In an instant,
﻿victory can turn into defeat.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:41.590
﻿That's the sad truth of battle.

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.890
﻿And the battlefield is a wasteland...

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:48.300
﻿But who is this old guy?

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:53.640
﻿That's Yuuki's Gunpla.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:57.570
﻿It's like a comet burning crimson...

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:02.980
﻿I can't believe I lost
﻿in this battle of toys.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:11.490
﻿That jerk!

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:15.730
﻿I'm irritated by that Yuuki guy.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.960
﻿Barging into a battle like that.

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:22.400
﻿But Yuuki sure built strong Gunpla.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.140
﻿With its quality, and his skills...

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:30.510
﻿He really has the ability of
﻿a World Tournament contestant.

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.440
﻿We completely lost.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.730
﻿No, we didn't!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:34.740
﻿He said it himself.
﻿No, we didn't!

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:36.390
﻿He said it himself.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.880
﻿Let's stop the battle here.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.890
﻿Judging from your machine's
﻿workmanship and movement,

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:48.530
﻿it appears to be incomplete.

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:54.800
﻿I want you to perfect it
﻿before the championship.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:58.400
﻿I want to fight against
﻿your truly completed Gunpla.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:03.140
﻿Yuuki, why are you being so...

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:06.840
﻿I'll tell you if you can beat me.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:12.020
﻿﻿And the championship is
the perfect stage for that.

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:16.250
﻿He's right. This isn't settled yet.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:20.020
﻿Sei, complete that Gunpla.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:21.120
﻿Reiji...?

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.860
﻿We have to pay him back.
﻿Especially for the humiliation!

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:30.030
- ﻿Let's play Gunpla Battle!
- ﻿Are you sure?

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.670
﻿It's decided!

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.970
﻿Reiji.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:39.010
﻿Maybe Yuuki...

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:42.510
﻿He barged into the battle
﻿to fire up Reiji.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:51.890
﻿Reiji, I'll complete this Gunpla...

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:57.090
﻿The Build Strike Gundam.
﻿I'll make it the best...

00:21:57.090 --> 00:22:00.000
﻿no, the strongest machine!

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:02.230
﻿I'm counting on you!

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:04.400
﻿Yeah.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:10.310
﻿You're glowing...?

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:13.110
﻿Looks like it's almost time.

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:14.140
﻿See you.

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:24.950
﻿What's going on!?

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:58.330
﻿This is the fully equipped
﻿Build Strike!

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:00.730
- ﻿What's the difference?
﻿- I hate you!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:02.260
Next episode, "Full Package".

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.370
I'm seeing the tears of time.
